= Labor Affairs

Catalonia's textile mills have gone silent. Rather than accept the wage terms set by a UGT-dominated *jurado mixto* (mixed arbitration board), the employers have declared a lockout, and the dispute threatens to spread to the mines of Asturias. As Labor Minister, Largo Caballero must decide how to use the Ministry's new arbitration powers.

- @support_labor: Uphold the *jurado mixto*'s ruling and side with the workers.
- @support_employers: Side with the employers and suspend the ruling.
- @balance: Push both sides toward a negotiated compromise.
- @easy_discard
#- @cancel_advisor_action

@support_labor
subtitle: Popular among organized labor, this will alienate employers and much of the propertied middle class.
on-arrival: labor_strength += 5; labor_dissent -= 5; left_dissent -= 5; industrial_psoe += 6*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; radical_relation -= 4; izq_rep_relation -= 2; capital_strike_progress += 1 if radical_relation <= 30; capital_strike_progress += 1 if unemployed > 15; capital_strike_progress += 1 if unemployed > 24; inflation += 0.1; strike_term_seen += 1; economic_growth -= 0.1

Backing labor is always popular with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**UGT**</span> rank and file, though several of our republican coalition partners answer to their own middle-class and business constituencies, and are less enthused.

@support_employers
subtitle: Popular among employers, much less so among the workers.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 8; industrial_psoe -= 3; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0; radical_relation += 5; ceda_relation += 5; izq_rep_relation += 4; industrial_pce += 3; pce_relation -= 8; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 1; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 8; strike_term_seen += 1

The Caballerista wing of the party is furious at suspending the board's own ruling against the workers, and the <span style="color: #700000;">**PCE**</span> and the anarchist <span style="color: #b35900;">**CNT**</span> are quick to say they told the workers so.

@balance
subtitle: Both sides need to share the burden of the current crisis.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 4; industrial_psoe -= 2; pce_relation -= 5; strike_term_seen += 1; izq_rep_relation += 4

Many workers are unhappy at our compromise, but the Republican-Socialist coalition holds together for the moment.
